# The target is "creature you control", any of them: on turn 3 Bot1's Forest doubles Hercules, Prince of Power (3 -> 6), not the
# Harmonizer (still 4). Bot2's Elvish Mystic is refused as a target (beside the legal Hercules, the positive control). Bot2's own
# Island entering on turn 2 triggers nothing ("a land you control"): the stack is empty after it and Bot1's creatures are
# unchanged.

